<title>POLAND: Poland sets issue price of 1-yr bonds at 95.00.</title>
<headline>Poland sets issue price of 1-yr bonds at 95.00.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish finance ministry set the issue price of its one-year index-linked bonds, maturing June 4, 1998, at 95.00 and the subscription price at 94.50, the ministry said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>It said 900 million zlotys of the paper will be available on subscription from April 24 to May 7 and will be offered to the public from June 3.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
